personal or commercial projects; anything you generate with them is
yours, no attribution or fee required. You may NOT: sell or
redistribute the prompts themselves (including in paid courses,
communities, or prompt-aggregation sites); share member-only content;
remove embedded tracking marks; or use the author's brand
("马哥AI落地") for promotion without written permission. Member
content is licensed per-person with embedded fingerprints; leaks are
traceable and may result in termination and civil claims. Third-party
assets (fonts, GSAP, hyperframes) are governed by their own licenses.
Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind; liability limited to
the maximum extent permitted by law. Commercial licensing beyond this
scope: contact the author via the channels listed above.
